Third-party designs
===================

solarian_arm_1/assets/
  The solarian-arm1 mechanical design, its meshes and its MuJoCo model are
  derived from the SO-ARM100 (Standard Open Arm 100) by The Robot Studio
  (https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100), Apache License 2.0, and
  modified, including an added wrist yaw joint and different servos.
  Meshes named so_arm100_* and sts3215_* come from that design.

